#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/kf6/kf6-frameworks.xml:383
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Any modules that have been omitted can be installed later by using the same "
"<command>mkdir build; cd build; cmake; make; make install</command> "
"procedure as above."
msgstr ""
"Quaisquer módulos que tenham sido omitidos podem ser instalados "
"posteriormente usando-se o mesmo procedimento <command>mkdir build; cd "
"build; cmake; make; make install</command> conforme acima."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/kf6/kf6-frameworks.xml:390
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Useless systemd units have been installed in <filename "
"class=\"directory\">$KF6_PREFIX/lib</filename>. Remove them now (as &root;):"
msgstr ""
"Unidades do systemd inúteis foram instaladas em <filename "
"class=\"directory\">$KF6_PREFIX/lib</filename>. Remova-as agora (como "
"&root;):"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/kde/kf6/kf6-frameworks.xml:396
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>rm -rf $KF6_PREFIX/lib/systemd</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>rm -rf $KF6_PREFIX/lib/systemd</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/kf6/kf6-frameworks.xml:399
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Sometimes the installation paths are hardcoded into installed files.  If the"
" installed directory is not /usr, rename the directory and create a symlink:"
msgstr ""
"Ocasionalmente, os caminhos de instalação estão rigidamente codificados nos "
"arquivos instalados. Se o diretório instalado não for /usr, renomeie o "
"diretório e crie um link simbólico:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/kde/kf6/kf6-frameworks.xml:404
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mv -v /opt/kf6 /opt/kf6-&kf6-version;\n"
"ln -sfvn kf6-&kf6-version; /opt/kf6</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mv -v /opt/kf6 /opt/kf6-&kf6-version;\n"
"ln -sfvn kf6-&kf6-version; /opt/kf6</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/kde/kf6/kf6-frameworks.xml:410
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/kf6/kf6-frameworks.xml:413
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D CMAKE_PREFIX_PATH=$QT6DIR</parameter>: This switch is used to "
"allow cmake to find the proper Qt libraries."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D CMAKE_PREFIX_PATH=$QT6DIR</parameter>: Essa chave é usada para"
" permitir que cmake encontre as bibliotecas Qt adequadas."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/kf6/kf6-frameworks.xml:418
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release</parameter>: This switch is used to "
"apply higher level of the compiler optimizations."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release</parameter>: Essa chave é usada para "
"aplicar um nível mais alto de otimização à compilação."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/kf6/kf6-frameworks.xml:423
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D BUILD_TESTING=OFF</parameter>: This switch is used to prevent "
"building test programs and libraries that are of no use to an end user."
